# Overlay patches are byte-exact inputs to patch --fuzz=0. Any patch against
# an upstream file stored with CRLF carries CRLF hunks (0006/0007 did, against
# ZAPDTR/OTRExporter, until 9.3.0 retired them -- D-079); a core.autocrlf
# checkout that strips the CRs makes such a patch unappliable (GitHub issue #1,
# part 3). Never convert them.
overlay/patches/*.patch -text
overlay/assets/*.patch -text
